<title>JAPAN: Tokyo stock market closed on Thursday for holiday.</title>
<headline>Tokyo stock market closed on Thursday for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo stock market is closed on Thursday for a national holiday and will reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the key 225-share Nikkei average lost 167.70 points or 0.80 percent to finish at 20,870.83. Its December futures shed 120 points to end at 20,910.</p>
